-- Migração 39 (cw_prod): categorias v2, investimentos fora dos gastos e exclusão de arquivos importados. Cole no SQL Editor do Supabase e clique em Run. Tudo roda numa única transação: se algo falhar, nada é aplicado.
begin;
-- GENERATED by scripts/gen-migrations.mjs from supabase/templates. Do not edit by hand.
-- Gate 29 (D-063): categories v2, investments apart from spending, and deleting an imported file.
-- 1. Taxonomy: the categories the client sees (4 income, 19 spending/asset) with the budget group of each (essential,
--    variable, financial obligations). Subcategories keep their codes (rules, transactions and history stay valid) and
--    move to the new categories; WORK, PROTECTION and OTHER become inactive (empty). Additive: nothing is dropped.
-- 2. Asset purchases and investments (group INVESTMENT_SAVINGS) are not consumption: the monthly consolidation keeps
--    them out of spending and reports them as "invested"; income is also reported per category (salary, rents...).
-- 3. A client (or the team) can delete one imported file: its transactions go with it and the original is removed.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1. taxonomy
